{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Before the end of the world, you died.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But Stella didn't want to see such an ending, so you resurrected in another timeline of the world and started your battle again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Distinctive Card-Based Combat</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique energy system with unconventional draw and discard mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Powerful synergies\u2014and tensions\u2014between cards and parasites</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenging and uniquely designed enemies</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361600/extras/\u6218\u6597\u5c55\u793a3.gif?t=1749202366\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Grow stronger before the sun sets each day</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Random events emerge across the area as time passes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle, gather supplies, enhance your deck\u2014every choice matters, and time is limited</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At sundown, face the boss in a fight to the death</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361600/extras/\u5173\u5361\u5c55\u793a3.gif?t=1749202366\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A variety of random events await</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trade in black market, enhance cards through meditation, uncover powerful parasites</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unexpected surprises</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361600/extras/\u4e8b\u4ef6\u5c55\u793a2.gif?t=1749202366\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Contents of the Demo Version</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 playable hero</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">100+ cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50+ unique parasites and props</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 major areas (featuring 40 regular enemies, 6 elites, and 3 bosses)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361600/extras/\u5185\u5bb9\u91cf\u5c55\u793a2.gif?t=1749202366\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">More interesting content and features are still under development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Discord\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3361600?t=1749202366","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3361600?t=1749202366","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361600/ded357e38179b1c10fd5a9937434bd23d9cac6ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749202366","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361600/ded357e38179b1c10fd5a9937434bd23d9cac6ab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749202366","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"General adult content, fantasy violence"},"demos":[{"appid":3689110,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Before the end of the world, you died.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But Stella didn't want to see such an ending, so you resurrected in another timeline of the world and started your battle again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Distinctive Card-Based Combat</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique energy system with unconventional draw and discard mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_para